{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:50 2026-06-10 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今(10日)中午約1時，啟德郵輪碼頭近入口，一名年約20歲非華裔青年，由15米高墮下，當場昏迷不醒，無呼吸無脈搏，被送往聯合醫院，惜經搶救後不治。警方正調查事件。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b9ee1357751a774ffa355fe11b35b9c/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_13_48_18_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a7807bf12b9f13f69ceef1dc40312035/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_13_48_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"青年由高處墮下昏迷送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/75aba8deb95c735605d91e64b6796a13/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_13_42_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/88cc75e77d5eee45cc3aee452282b348/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_13_42_09_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e3d6c833532b5dbcd7091e7ca0f0e67e/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_13_42_09_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c763928487615783cf2816baa611c948/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-10_at_13_42_08.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-10T07:20:27.941271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}